  "details": "I think the game and the community would greatly benefit from more performance options that make VRChat a smoother experience for everyone. Adding options like TAA could improve visual quality by reducing shimmering and producing cleaner edges. An additional TAAU option could also help lower-end devices by offering better performance in demanding worlds, which would be especially valuable for Quest, PC, and iOS users who struggle with hardware limits. This could make VRChat more accessible to people who can’t afford newer equipment and help more users enjoy the game comfortably.",
